{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Escape reserved markers in non-persisted exception data.** Virtual/flat and late child failures use this raw value, then `deserializeException` interprets any `@aws-durable-payload:` prefix as an SDK envelope. A valid custom SerDes emitting that prefix therefore turns a branch failure into `PayloadOffloadException` and can fail the invocation. Encode it through `serializePreEncodedPayload` with the disabled offloader and validate using that same policy; add flat map/parallel coverage.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7ok8oB","finding_digest":"66904d84c929877cd71670330f903fc15742554618421a82c82112e8f218b42b","finding_id":"arf_v1_m2ie3bgjfgdxzvywoazq7eb7yf","finding_key":"sdk/operation/serializabledurableoperation::serializeexceptionwithoutoffloading::reserved-marker-isolation","identity_key":"sdk/operation/serializabledurableoperation::serializeexceptionwithoutoffloading::reserved-marker-isolation","line":285,"observation_digest":"43edb4467bd164838e0d42a9d72703aee35484808e44b052cc0c46bb1660e705","observation_id":"aro_v1_ipw3irt32fsihdqniku5ojydv3","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/SerializableDurableOperation.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T07:59:37Z","review_id":"arr_v1_rl5vu7kq4ubjdcdgv33i4dfywp","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"d0d5daf31c7506198c75504c1f776163a052bfec","reviewer":"codex","start_line":285,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_wttex52o73fttpic5e4m4k6mhm","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T07:59:37Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
